			dependencies: ["7D5E30D919EC171F"]
			description: ["The &6Powder Bed Printer&r melts atomised metal powder layer by layer into parts that no machine tool could cut. Its controller, UV casing and a heated bed under an argon blanket. Thruster chambers, array mounts and probe frames. Powder and argon are kept; stock the printed parts by ME."]
