			dependencies: ["3AB434D5A69FAF2B"]
			description: ["The &6Starchip Fab&r bonds and dices a photonic chip, a qubit and a source into a probe that weighs a gram. Its controller, clean room casing and a filter hood; kerf is voidable. The starchip in the circuits chapter. Parts by ME; dicing waste goes to a void."]
