		{
			dependencies: ["3D0F0BDA824B2E7B"]
			description: ["The &6Laser Sail Launcher&r on the Moon pushes the sail with a beam of light until it leaves the Solar System. Its controller, UV casing and a ring of &6Laser Module Blocks&r. The probe in flight, and the data it sends home. One launch at a time; power it from the network and keep the probes stocked."]
