		{
			dependencies: ["7D3D51F478AD6842"]
			description: ["The &6Triton Geyser Sampler&r flies through the plumes of nitrogen ice that Triton throws, and brings back an ice core. Its controller, the station truss casing and a probe hangar of titanium frames. Triton nitrogen, and the ice core that grows the next seed. A cartridge per run by ME; collect the core and the nitrogen from the hatches."]
