			dependencies: ["75BE44AC4E14F680"]
			description: ["The &6Event Horizon Interferometer&r combines dishes across the Solar System into one telescope, aimed at the black hole at the galaxy's centre. Its controller, the station truss casing, a pressure hull casing, a dish and a maser clock. The Sgr A* image, the end of the Pluto row. Catalogue and data by ME; it needs no other input."]
